! Written disabled, matching nothing:
!   firewall 1 (defconf: accept in ipsec policy): not converted: ipsec-policy=in,ipsec (traffic of IPsec tunnels)
!   firewall 2 (banned scanners): not converted: address list 'scanners', which rules fill while the router runs
!   firewall 3 (ssh from the admins): zones DMZ: a policy names the interfaces lan, wan1, wan2 or all (give --zone-map ZONE=lan|wan1|wan2)
