!   firewall 7 (ping "echo" only-2): zones DMZ: a policy names the interfaces lan, wan1, wan2 or all (give --zone-map ZONE=lan|wan1|wan2); an ICMP type or code: a policy matches every ICMP message or none
!   firewall 8 (old partner access): zones DMZ: a policy names the interfaces lan, wan1, wan2 or all (give --zone-map ZONE=lan|wan1|wan2); every service but some: a policy names one protocol and its ports
