!   firewall 17 (guest DNS, either port): zones GUEST, WAN: a policy names the interfaces lan, wan1, wan2 or all (give --zone-map ZONE=lan|wan1|wan2)
!   firewall 18 (guest DNS, either port-2): zones GUEST, WAN: a policy names the interfaces lan, wan1, wan2 or all (give --zone-map ZONE=lan|wan1|wan2)
!   firewall 19 (guests to the internet): zones GUEST, WAN: a policy names the interfaces lan, wan1, wan2 or all (give --zone-map ZONE=lan|wan1|wan2)
!   firewall 20 (office hours for staff): schedule 'time=8h-18h,mon,tue,wed,thu,fri' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times; zones WAN: a policy names the interfaces lan, wan1, wan2 or all (give --zone-map ZONE=lan|wan1|wan2)
